# Plugin environment. Copy to agents/<name>/.env when you create a plugin from this template.
# The plugin reads it itself in setup() with dotenv_values() (never into os.environ, which every
# plugin shares); its values win over the Backend's process environment. Never committed, never
# copied into Docker images.

# Add the settings your brain reads in setup() (e.g. an LLM endpoint). The echo stub needs none.
# The LiteLLM agents use:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_BASE_URL=https://…/v1
# LLM_MODEL=
# LLM_TIMEOUT_S=120
